  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">《</span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">我無痟（五）</span><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">》</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">/</span><span style=\"text-align: left;\">杜信龍</span><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhuY2-3g-r6q4x-_s9b-bdLYBaNFoRHvhP1BVVLo7boaZKAgP1J0xi6sO5hHJnbAbzME0bRbiJA8W0Q2AhoWg5Fhrk1ZAa41WWOzyHwSvqoHzvCiz3hQZE4vLnN95xIknivwxH-AHuSoEkDjkMbvk0T-8IP-GMPmiI2e2VCMIDVQktL9S-fhs_-UB61kw_N\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhuY2-3g-r6q4x-_s9b-bdLYBaNFoRHvhP1BVVLo7boaZKAgP1J0xi6sO5hHJnbAbzME0bRbiJA8W0Q2AhoWg5Fhrk1ZAa41WWOzyHwSvqoHzvCiz3hQZE4vLnN95xIknivwxH-AHuSoEkDjkMbvk0T-8IP-GMPmiI2e2VCMIDVQktL9S-fhs_-UB61kw_N\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh_-yil0mg2iBbASvAdN_Rx7bHbVoRG10EFTIV6Q2jYqWtZXLDznj4FWh3hU1TJVeMKEb5tW8C2yQxRaREUcz6Of2NcT2aIelN18fXp580nwgyhMXKyUbfPVsvxPcm1jOCzFJYCSzQVdPoa3ZIROWdxRjjPnSGVhzABmJpXRrITJJcKqAIWgB0RN-T3GE7e\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEh_-yil0mg2iBbASvAdN_Rx7bHbVoRG10EFTIV6Q2jYqWtZXLDznj4FWh3hU1TJVeMKEb5tW8C2yQxRaREUcz6Of2NcT2aIelN18fXp580nwgyhMXKyUbfPVsvxPcm1jOCzFJYCSzQVdPoa3ZIROWdxRjjPnSGVhzABmJpXRrITJJcKqAIWgB0RN-T3GE7e=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></h2><h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><span style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjxzbZb1W-DO-QYrnmgNUaH0qaYJNstl7CIzXQdVPfNswPPnSjp_njapuSxu-6CSMeflnXruWg0Ub47OMKmwRK1RbAKWdGS98ZjLKp1IfRkDFQ_7LohzzltkEH3vhAB_r2nB-iIOZ9rA-DlrAn8mM4VvedenWZedMWc81xyyHR_3KOYHl_0Q9CJYn5O4X80\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjxzbZb1W-DO-QYrnmgNUaH0qaYJNstl7CIzXQdVPfNswPPnSjp_njapuSxu-6CSMeflnXruWg0Ub47OMKmwRK1RbAKWdGS98ZjLKp1IfRkDFQ_7LohzzltkEH3vhAB_r2nB-iIOZ9rA-DlrAn8mM4VvedenWZedMWc81xyyHR_3KOYHl_0Q9CJYn5O4X80\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"></a><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtVb83WktIZo0M6cf8ZYASL1YnOazr-wyd-8gVjPCRfWiSoaqaF8woZi1HOTvqbNq7C60T2Gv2cGYg_rU0LlrdtJ0E2Y30yF-4hyuK1cqpwVZ6zi_0eG8Lama_z2W1b207FDwQcbQS_617YBHKeNqS7XVUvZUGW7rw9N7zd2cbGRnLiyafxDZhsXyn9LbZ\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"1518\" data-original-width=\"1075\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEgtVb83WktIZo0M6cf8ZYASL1YnOazr-wyd-8gVjPCRfWiSoaqaF8woZi1HOTvqbNq7C60T2Gv2cGYg_rU0LlrdtJ0E2Y30yF-4hyuK1cqpwVZ6zi_0eG8Lama_z2W1b207FDwQcbQS_617YBHKeNqS7XVUvZUGW7rw9N7zd2cbGRnLiyafxDZhsXyn9LbZ=w453-h640\" width=\"453\" /></a></div></div></div></div></span></div></div></div></span></h2><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">洪華昌tī立法院ê聲勢愈來愈koân，逐日新聞lóng leh報。Tng拄beh開車門ê時，手機仔giang-giang叫，伊有真無好ê預感，he應該是傅--ê。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「Ôe？」真正是傅蜈蜞khà--來--ê。「你liam-mi過來我chia。」Hit爿一个捲舌ê聲音，直接命令傅蜈蜞。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>原本beh tńg去厝內替丈姆慶祝母親節，mā tio̍h-ài拒絕。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>伊照指示，車駛來到北京一路，hit間名叫小六仔ê包仔店就拄好tī中節路段，真好揣。Che khăng-pàng是創始人習不平ê題字牌匾，總--是，伊ài人叫伊大頭家。斟酌kā看，下排koh有『兩岸血濃於水』ê字句。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>車窗絞--落-來，使一下目尾隨有人接伊ê手，講是beh替伊停車。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>本chiâⁿ行路慢慢仔行，leh思考等--leh是啥mih狀況，tī khăng-pàng頭前soah看kah gōng神，m̄知影停偌久。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「洪總--ê，kám講ài請大頭家親身出來請你入--去？」一个聲音m̄知影tùi佗來，看--來是內底ê人ē-sái看著外口所有ê影像。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>行--入-去ê時，一chūn茶芳chhîⁿ--過-來，hō͘人一時仔放輕鬆，燈管ê光輻射燒lō，算有光chhiûⁿ，兩枝koân-long-long ê龍柱chhāi tī大廳雙爿。跤步踏tī紅地毯，軟sìm-sìm。一个穿長裙ê查某服務生行--來，伊細細蕊仔ê目睭看bē出是m̄是有leh認真看--伊--無，giú長長ê目尾beh到鬢邊，冷冷ê態度hō͘洪開始緊張--起-來，甚至有淡薄仔畏寒。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「直接起去五樓，正手爿上尾間，房號1314。」He服務生kā hoan咐。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>一下入--去，就看見傅--ê坐--leh，伊兩位助理徛tī後壁。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「來來，洪總--ê。緊來坐，ē記得lán頂擺tī chia仝房間討論法案--無？Hah hah，食好食mi̍h，講政治談未來，有影是讚。」傅--ê ia̍t手，另外一手kí伊對面一个位，叫伊坐--落。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>桌仔頂無任何食mi̍h，甚至招牌包仔、茶水mā無。Kan-na一个豬肝色ê紙袋仔kah一台電腦。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「你紙袋仔拍開看māi--leh，che我無kā講。Che你人生大事，我有影替你恭喜，m̄知影你國外有一个後生。你有影真gâu，真gâu遨！你丈人、súi某kám知？」傅--ê講了。Hit兩位助理leh激一寡痟豬哥ê動作，洪華昌看kah鬱tī心內。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>內底是陳潔欣chhōa囡仔去教堂禮拜ê相片，看了愈來愈感覺chit个囡仔ê面容有影kah伊有成。其中一張，che囡仔手頭提ê hit本聖經，就是伊送hō͘陳潔欣--ê。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「潔欣有我ê囝，lóng無kā我講！」Taⁿ，伊開始想kám ē潔欣ê囡仔就是kah伊有--ê？Kám真正有影？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「洪總--ê，囡仔bē用得偷生。Che代誌若hō͘人知。你應該知影後果。做公關就煞煞--去，炒土地mā煞煞--去，王台強ê代誌處理了真súi-khùi，che大頭家lóng有囥tī心內。」傅--ê，一肢手搭tī洪國昌肩胛，輕輕仔摸洪ê頭毛。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>洪m̄知佗位來ê膽頭，hoah：「你chit个笑面虎，倒咬狗。有夠--ah--ŏ͘！Mài siuⁿ過離經！王台強ē死，陸民黨chiah應該負上大ê責任，mài牽來我chia。Che查某我mā無熟sāi，你mài烏白安我罪名。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「Hah hah，你有影當做你是鴨頭仔--o͘h。Beh選新北市？Ē用--得！Beh用你鴨bî仔黨ê名義，我看是bē用--得。Lán既然合作hiah久--ah，就應該進一步合作chiah tio̍h。」傅ê口氣真硬，講了起身門開--開，頭無越就走--ah。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>留--落-來ê兩位助理，一个kā門關--起-來，一个人kā電腦內ê影片直接投影去壁--裡。Tùi刺phè花學運到做立委所有一寡bē見光ê代誌lóng hō͘ in收集kah不止仔齊全。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>洪華昌一路看，無講一句話，一時仔笑，一下仔目屎輾--落-來。M̄-nā hit兩位助理感覺無tùi-tâng，hām伊mā對家己ê冷靜感覺意外。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「Che m̄是我。Che m̄是我。」洪華昌se̍h-se̍h唸。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>伊無法度認出過去ê家己，mā無認為現此時ê家己是真正ê家己。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>伊伸手入去se-bí-lo͘h內提薰，其中一个助理真自動tu一枝過--來。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>「我無愛suh “中华”--ê，kám無 “新樂園”？我kám是beh痟--ah。Suh薰lóng是毒，kám有差？」洪華昌笑笑仔問。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>落尾，隔工新聞頭條「鴨bî仔黨主席柯旻澈宣佈洪華昌委員身體健康ê因端，辭立法委員。伊ê位由陳智潭來接替。若是新北市選舉，阮黨全力支持陸民黨所推出ê候選人。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>過--無-幾-工，洪華昌一人tī立法院門口大聲唱：「刺phè hō͘火燒，總--是無燒--去；信徒受苦楚，iáu久無lóe志。教會受迫害，反tńg愈興起。Lán tio̍h-ài勇敢，為主來精進，苦難若愈大，lán tio̍h愈堅信……」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>愈唱愈大聲，一下仔笑，一下仔háu。大聲hoah，「我有信--ah。」</span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\">（煞）</span></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img alt=\"\" data-original-height=\"3035\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"480\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhP8BqQtewRqP_TMEiC7BVYzbVV20dPeRvO4KOPGhxz0JmHFAFggjy3k9qchVzLj53VqpExWL_A2-m-3_0ZQio6dW6-7YzVD7kuZ1b3YueOouv8IJut5QjgYBEMQlk82gaiHRsB3A_ekYkq22NuzUfE9xX8h2ExK4F58_cNu3WBf92fjMCfZpsSk1L_Puff\" width=\"340\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"background-color: white; clear: both; color: #444444; font-family: Arial, Tahoma, Helvetica, FreeSans, sans-serif; font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: medium;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: inherit; text-align: left; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8Abong%E5%A0%B1?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWDjUJsSxaPbx9rBf3emvc0qX31sZFFUgNNqOtI9vv64OwqXsGEcwI3lw-EjolqeunKDULXB2AzmrXPdDewdlrZi72lKhnFv6ZPAhhxYvK8KMzXeD-ekv7Y_z6BLYVkK4MlRank2JL7XQR1R13adh_SDiIvZcpr6jdEpFHPKpL2oc7EsEvYcOny0uZTPG13xlE&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\" role=\"link\" style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-color: transparent; border-color: initial; border-style: initial; border-width: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #3778cd; cursor: pointer; display: inline; font-family: inherit; list-style: none; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; text-align: inherit; text-decoration-line: none; touch-action: manipulation;\" tabindex=\"0\">#台文通訊BONG報</a></span><span face=\"&quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"text-align: lef